@*
    CONVENTION: every component folder carries a copy of this file.

    Razor derives a component's namespace from RootNamespace plus its folder path, which would
    scatter the library across ZenithUI.Components.Theming, ZenithUI.Components.Forms,
    ZenithUI.Components.Data and so on - forcing consumers to add a @using per folder and making
    any future reorganisation a breaking change for them.

    `@namespace` applies to the folder containing the _Imports.razor that declares it, so one of
    these per component folder flattens everything into `ZenithUI`. A consumer then needs exactly
    one using directive, and folders stay free to move.
*@

@namespace ZenithUI
